      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... are honoured to offer an outstanding three bedroom 115 sq mtrs. semi-detached property that is simply an expansive light filled dream home that would be ideal for the professional family wishing to find a wonderful property located in the Hollywoodrath development, with every amenity on your doorstep. The property has been finished with great flair, impeccable taste and meticulous attention to detail creating a stylish low maintenance home in such a central location, that's in truly walk in condition throughout. \r\n\r\nThe much anticipated release of this property to the market represents a rare and genuine opportunity to purchase a spacious home set in a well established Dublin location. The elegant exterior of this fine residence gives just a flavour of the exceptional craftsmanship and high standard of design which is evident throughout the house. Nothing has been left to chance as this magnificent property has been fully finished to provide the ultimate in modern living. \r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a beautiful entrance hall that flows seamlessly through to the kitchen and dining area, creating a wonderful sense of space and continuity. A discreetly positioned guest WC is located off the hallway. The generous kitchen offers an abundance of storage units and a comprehensive range of integrated appliances, complemented by a separate utility area. Completing the ground floor accommodation is a large living room, flooded with natural light and providing a bright and inviting space for everyday living and entertaining. Upstairs, there are three spacious bedrooms, each featuring fitted wardrobes and ample storage. The main bedroom benefits from a stylish en-suite, while the main family bathroom completes the accommodation on this level. Outside, the rear garden is a real jewel. Enjoying a glorious easterly aspect, it is private, enclosed and fully landscaped, providing a wonderful outdoor space to relax and entertain.\r\n\r\nThis fine family home is truly unique in that it creates the smart home technology of modern living. Sheer good taste and stylish elegance prevails throughout, from the entrance hallway through the entire house and no expense has been spared by its current owners on the extensive upgrading they have completed in recent years.  The location of this property is truly second to none, offering the perfect balance of convenience, accessibility and tranquillity. Situated in Hollystown, Dublin 15, the property enjoys a peaceful rural setting while remaining within easy reach of Dublin City and all major transport routes. The area benefits from an excellent road network, with the M2, M3 and N3 all easily accessible, providing convenient connections to the M50 and beyond. Dublin Airport is also approximately a 15-minute drive away, making this an ideal location for commuters and frequent travellers alike. Families are well catered for, with a choice of both primary and secondary schools in the surrounding area, including Educate Together, St. Brigid’s National School, St. Paul’s National School and Scoil Chóil Mhuire Secondary School. Everyday shopping and amenities are also close at hand, with local convenience facilities available at Tyrrelstown Town Centre, while Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is approximately 4 km away and provides an extensive range of shops, restaurants and services.\r\n\r\nProperties of this calibre rarely come to the market so early viewing is essential, highly recommended and by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS 01-8844690."
      },
